cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CoCoFold2, please cite the CoCoFold2 manuscript and this software release."
title: "CoCoFold2: Diffusion-enabled Experimental Latent Test-time Adaptation of Frozen Protein Structure Priors"
type: software
authors:
